name atomic-2020
# ATOMIC 2020: commonsense tuples, a head, a relation and a tail on every line, in three files.
# The witness is named as the set's README.md titles itself: "# ATOMIC 2020 Knowledge Graph".
witness ATOMIC 2020 Knowledge Graph
# The deviation is this recipe's choice for a curated academic resource; the specification does not give one.
deviation 90
root $LAPLACE_DATA/Atomic2020
reads text
# Measured when it was loaded: 1,913,456 compositions from 68 MB, at 750 bytes each with their indexes and standings.
room 21
after unicode iso-639
